--TEST--
a cursor inside an `autoload` prefix answers the namespace it maps and every root a name in it is looked for in, in probe order, a missing root included and said to be missing — `rule:programs/autoload`
--FILE--
<?nvs
autoload 'Ap<|>p' from 'src', 'gone';
--FILE src/User.nvs--
<?nvs
namespace App;
class User { }
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
```nvs
namespace App
```

A name in this namespace is looked for in these directories, in this order:

- `src`
- `gone` (does not exist)
